<section class="mt-10 max-w-3xl" id="about">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-2">What is Maid Cafe Simulator?</h2>
    <p class="text-slate-200 text-[17px] leading-relaxed">In this single-player, first-person management sim, you inherit a failing café and turn it into a maid café. You take orders, prepare drinks, collect payments, restock supplies, and share tasks with five animal-eared maids. A chapter-based main story and individual bond stories run alongside café expansion and inspections.</p>
</section>
<section class="mt-8 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 max-w-3xl">
        <div class="rounded-lg bg-slate-900 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/20 p-4">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-300 mb-2">For you if...</h2>
        <ul class="text-[15px] text-slate-200 space-y-1.5"><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">+</span><span>you enjoy dialogue-heavy games with an anime-style cast</span></li></ul>
    </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg bg-slate-900 ring-1 ring-rose-500/20 p-4">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-rose-300 mb-2">Not for you if...</h2>
        <ul class="text-[15px] text-slate-200 space-y-1.5"><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-rose-400">−</span><span>you want extensive café decoration and furniture options</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-rose-400">−</span><span>you expect to cook food, not just prepare drinks</span></li></ul>
    </div>
    </section>
<section class="mt-8 max-w-3xl rounded-lg bg-slate-900 ring-1 ring-slate-800 p-4" id="players">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-1">What players say</h2>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-2">
        87% of 242 reviews are positive             </p>
    <p class="text-slate-200 text-[17px] leading-relaxed">Players praise the maids&#039; distinct personalities and voice acting. They frequently criticize outfit DLC pricing, and some say the daily routine becomes repetitive.</p>
</section>






