        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Does Maid Cafe Simulator run on Steam Deck?</h2>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="inline-block align-middle text-xs font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded ring-1 text-slate-300 bg-slate-500/15 ring-slate-500/30 mr-1">Untested</span> Not yet tested by Valve on Steam Deck.</p>
