                <span class="text-slate-400">Full audio:</span> Korean.                 <span class="text-slate-400">Text only:</span> English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, German, Russian, Spanish - Latin America.                            </dd></div>
        </dl>
    </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg bg-slate-900 ring-1 ring-slate-800 p-4" id="ai">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Does Maid Cafe Simulator use AI-generated content?</h2>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-300">Yes. The developers disclose AI-generated content on the game&#039;s Steam page:</p>
                                            <blockquote class="mt-2 border-l-2 border-amber-400/50 pl-3 text-sm text-slate-300 italic whitespace-pre-line" >• Translation: The in-game text and store page text in languages other than Korean were translated using AI tools, so some translations may read unnaturally or contain inaccuracies. We are running a community translation project on our Discord server and do our best to reflect players&#039; suggestions in future updates. If you&#039;d like to help, we&#039;d truly appreciate it!
• Art: Some food and cooking-related props were initially generated with AI-assisted tools and then manually refined by our artists to match the game&#039;s visual style and quality standards.
• Audio: Some short customer vocal sounds hea...</blockquote>
                        <details class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-300"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200">Full statement</summary><p class="mt-1 italic whitespace-pre-line" lang="en">• Translation: The in-game text and store page text in languages other than Korean were translated using AI tools, so some translations may read unnaturally or contain inaccuracies. We are running a community translation project on our Discord server and do our best to reflect players&#039; suggestions in future updates. If you&#039;d like to help, we&#039;d truly appreciate it!
• Art: Some food and cooking-related props were initially generated with AI-assisted tools and then manually refined by our artists to match the game&#039;s visual style and quality standards.
• Audio: Some short customer vocal sounds heard during café service (brief reactions and exclamations) were created using AI voice generation tools. All spoken dialogue in the game was recorded by real voice performers.</p></details>
                                                            
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">The statement mentions:
                <span class="inline-block ml-1 mt-1 text-xs font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-400/10 text-amber-200 ring-1 ring-amber-400/30">Art</span><span class="inline-block ml-1 mt-1 text-xs font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-400/10 text-amber-200 ring-1 ring-amber-400/30">Voices</span><span class="inline-block ml-1 mt-1 text-xs font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-400/10 text-amber-200 ring-1 ring-amber-400/30">Music &amp; sound</span><span class="inline-block ml-1 mt-1 text-xs font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-400/10 text-amber-200 ring-1 ring-amber-400/30">Text &amp; translations</span><span class="inline-block ml-1 mt-1 text-xs font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-400/10 text-amber-200 ring-1 ring-amber-400/30">Store page &amp; marketing</span>            </p>
                            <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400">Self-reported by the developer under Steam rules: it covers AI content that ships in the game, not tools used to make it.
            Steam page checked on Oct 27, 2026.            <a href="https://www.pcgame.com/steam-ai-filter" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300">How to filter AI games on Steam</a></p>
    </div>
    </section>


